            <h1 class="supporters-title">Rotary International</h1>
        </section>

        <section class="supporters-content-section">
            <h2>Rotary Clubs and BKFA</h2>
            <p>
                BKFA is proud to work alongside Rotary clubs in Australia and internationally, both in the assembly and
                distribution of our Clean Birth Kits.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="supporters-content-section">
            <div class="cards-grid supporters-impact-grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__text">
                        <h3>Rotary Maternal and Child Health Group - Nigeria</h3>
                        <p>234,000 Clean Birth Kits distributed since 2008</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card__text">
                        <h3>Rotary Mackindye - Uganda</h3>
                        <p>15,800 Clean Birth Kits distributed since 2013</p>
                    </div>
